# Contributors & Research Lineage

Portable Trust is the result of a research lineage built through
experiments, communities, hackathons, institutions and open-source
projects.

Authorship of this repository does not erase the authorship of the
people who contributed to the experiments that made this research
possible.

Contributions may include:

- research
- software
- design
- cryptography
- protocols
- governance
- field research
- artwork
- institutional knowledge
- mentoring
- testing
- infrastructure

Each experiment should preserve:

Contributor → Contribution → Experiment → Repository → License → Date
